<title>UK: RHEINHYP adds 500 mln marks to August 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>RHEINHYP adds 500 mln marks to August 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINHYP RHEINISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    26.AUG.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JULY 2003 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED 19.FEB.97 AS A 1.0 BLN DEM ISSUE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
